# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artifacts.  The project carries several C++ search kernels that are
# compiled locally (g++ -O3 -std=c++17 <name>.cpp -o <name>.exe); the sources are
# tracked, the binaries are not -- they are machine- and compiler-specific.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.o
*.obj
*.so
*.dll
*.dylib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Solver output.  `runs/` holds every intermediate plan, checkpoint and probe
# from both the preliminary and semi-final searches.  It reached 864 MB of the
# repository's 904 MB during the semi-final run, and none of it is source: every
# file is regenerated by the commands in README.md.  The chunks under
# `runs/*/chunks/` are per-block checkpoints of `solve_semi.py` and are likewise
# reproducible.
#
# `diagnostics/` is deliberately NOT ignored: it holds the calibrated knife and
# yield evidence that README.md cites (`knife_calibration.json`,
# `yield_semantics.json`, `knife_cap_research.md`), and it is only 1 MB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
runs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python bytecode and caches.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch space.  `tmp/` holds the throwaway profiling scripts written while
# diagnosing the closing-search cost and the over-production bug; they are kept
# out of history because they are one-off measurements, not part of the solver.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tmp/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local editor / OS cruft.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
